<title>UK: Galois sets 35 bln yen five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Galois sets 35 bln yen five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager IBJ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GALOIS</p>
<p> AMT    35 BLN YEN    COUPON     2.75	MATURITY    10.JUN.yr</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    10.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMS US/UK/CY/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND   0.20	 SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
